# ABP Emailing

## Sending Emails
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly IEmailSender _emailSender;

    public async Task SendWelcomeEmailAsync(string to)
    {
        await _emailSender.SendAsync(
            to,
            "Welcome!",
            "Welcome to our application..."
        );
    }
}
```

## Email Configuration
```json
{
  "Settings": {
    "Abp.Mailing.DefaultFromAddress": "noreply@mydomain.com",
    "Abp.Mailing.DefaultFromDisplayName": "My Application",
    "Abp.Mailing.Smtp.Host": "smtp.mydomain.com",
    "Abp.Mailing.Smtp.Port": "587",
    "Abp.Mailing.Smtp.UserName": "username",
    "Abp.Mailing.Smtp.Password": "password",
    "Abp.Mailing.Smtp.EnableSsl": "true"
  }
}
```

## MailKit Integration
Install `Volo.Abp.MailKit` for MailKit-based implementation (recommended for production).

## Background Email Sending
Use `IBackgroundEmailSender` to queue emails for background processing.
